<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>承韵非遗 - 中国非物质文化遗产传承平台</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
        }
        .hero-bg {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.3)), 
                        url('https://picsum.photos/id/106/1920/800');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }
        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 60px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #8B4513;
            margin: 12px auto 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-stone-50 text-stone-800">
    <!-- 导航栏 -->
    <nav class="fixed top-0 w-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm z-50">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-900">承韵非遗</div>
            <div class="hidden md:flex gap-8 text-sm">
                <a href="#about" class="hover:text-amber-800 transition">关于我们</a>
                <a href="#products" class="hover:text-amber-800 transition">产品服务</a>
                <a href="#culture" class="hover:text-amber-800 transition">企业文化</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="hover:text-amber-800 transition">联系我们</a>
            </div>
            <div class="md:hidden text-amber-900">☰</div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- 首页Banner -->
    <section class="hero-bg h-screen flex items-center justify-center text-white text-center pt-16">
        <div class="px-4">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-4 tracking-wider">传承千年 · 匠心守护</h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl mb-8 opacity-90">中国非物质文化遗产活化传承平台</p>
            <a href="#about" class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-amber-800 hover:bg-amber-900 rounded-full transition">
                了解更多
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 关于我们 - 6大维度 -->
    <section id="about" class="py-20 px-4">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center section-title mb-16">关于承韵</h2>
            
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16 items-center">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">📍 区位布局 Location</h3>
                    <p class="leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
                        总部位于四川成都国际非物质文化遗产博览园，在苏州、景德镇、丽江设立三大非遗工坊分站，
                        深度对接西南、华东、华南的非遗原产地资源，构建覆盖全国的技艺传承网络。
                    </p>
                </div>
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1031/600/400" alt="公司区位" class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full">
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16 items-center md:flex-row-reverse">
                <div class="md:order-2">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">🇨🇳 企业属性 Nationality</h3>
                    <p class="leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
                        中国本土全资文化企业，专注中华非遗保护与创新，签约32位国家级、省市级非遗传承人，
                        所有业务植根中国传统文化，致力于向全球传播东方非遗美学。
                    </p>
                </div>
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1059/600/400" alt="企业资质" class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full md:order-1">
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16 items-center">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">📦 产品服务 Products</h3>
                    <ul class="leading-relaxed text-stone-700 space-y-2">
                        <li>• 非遗文创衍生品：刺绣、陶瓷、竹编、剪纸等日用文创</li>
                        <li>• 非遗体验课程：线下手作课、线上匠人直播、团建定制</li>
                        <li>• 非遗展演策划：展会、市集、民俗活动全案执行</li>
                        <li>• 数字化保护：非遗数字建档、VR展馆、3D技艺复原</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/225/600/400" alt="文创产品" class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full">
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16 items-center">
                <div class="md:order-2">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">📊 企业规模 Scale</h3>
                    <p class="leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
                        全职员工68人，签约非遗传承人32位，合作传统工坊17个，覆盖11大类非遗技艺。
                        线下3个直营体验空间，年服务用户超15万人次，业务覆盖全国12个省市。
                    </p>
                </div>
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1071/600/400" alt="工坊规模" class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full md:order-1">
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16 items-center">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">🏢 组织架构 Organizational Structure</h3>
                    <p class="leading-relaxed text-stone-700 mb-3">
                        董事会统筹战略，总经理负责日常运营，下设五大核心部门：
                    </p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm">
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 p-3 rounded">文化传承部</div>
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 p-3 rounded">产品研发部</div>
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 p-3 rounded">市场运营部</div>
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 p-3 rounded">数字技术部</div>
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 p-3 rounded col-span-2 text-center">行政人事部</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1074/600/400" alt="团队架构" class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full">
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                <div class="md:order-2">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">🎋 企业文化 Culture</h3>
                    <div class="space-y-3 text-stone-700">
                        <p><span class="font-semibold text-amber-900">核心理念：</span>守正创新，薪火相传</p>
                        <p><span class="font-semibold text-amber-900">企业使命：</span>让非遗走进现代生活</p>
                        <p><span class="font-semibold text-amber-900">价值观：</span>敬畏传统、拥抱创新、匠人共生</p>
                        <p><span class="font-semibold text-amber-900">愿景：</span>东方非遗美学的全球传播者</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1060/600/400" alt="企业文化" class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full md:order-1">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 产品展示 -->
    <section id="products" class="py-20 px-4 bg-stone-100">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center section-title mb-16">核心产品</h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/175/400/300" alt="文创产品" class="w-full h-56 object-cover">
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-amber-900">非遗文创系列</h3>
                        <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm">将传统技艺融入日常用品，让美学触手可及</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/287/400/300" alt="体验课程" class="w-full h-56 object-cover">
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-amber-900">手作体验课程</h3>
                        <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm">跟随匠人亲手制作，深度感受非遗魅力</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1073/400/300" alt="数字非遗" class="w-full h-56 object-cover">
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-amber-900">数字化保护</h3>
                        <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm">用科技留存技艺，让非遗跨越时空传承</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 联系我们 -->
    <section id="contact" class="py-20 px-4">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold section-title mb-12">联系我们</h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-stone-700">
                <div>
                    <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📍</div>
                    <p class="font-semibold mb-1">总部地址</p>
                    <p class="text-sm">上海民航职业技术学院</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📞</div>
                    <p class="font-semibold mb-1">联系电话</p>
                    <p class="text-sm">778400035</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📧</div>
                    <p class="font-semibold mb-1">商务邮箱</p>
                    <p class="text-sm">contact@chengyun-feiyi.com</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 页脚 -->
    <footer class="bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 py-8 px-4 text-center text-sm">
        <p>© 2026 承韵非遗文化发展有限公司 版权所有</p>
        <p class="mt-2 opacity-70">守正创新 · 薪火相传</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // 平滑滚动
        document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="#"]').forEach(anchor => {
            anchor.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('href')).scrollIntoView({
                    behavior: 'smooth'
                });
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
